          "@value": "Minimum data set for health workforce registry"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Table 3 (pages 24-25): ten data sets, each a group of data elements, with one data-element sheet per element on the pages that follow. Represented here for cross-reference only (owner, 2026-11-12: the 2015 MDS is cross-referenced from DTH-HRH, not the basis of its core data elements). Non-definitional.",
